# Byte-exact files: checksums (SHA256SUMS of the drivers) and reference files
# must not get CRLF line ends on a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the
# GitHub Windows runners broke test_csv_format and test_dll_v6 there).
# The source archives of GitHub are not affected: they keep the bytes as committed.
drivers/** -text
tests/reference/** -text
tests/data/** -text
